\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1  \cf0  God's angel came from the heavens
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   and spoke to the shepherds, saying
\par   do not be afraid, make merry
\par   Take heart and do not be afraid.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Behold! I bring you good tidings
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   which is for you and all the world
\par   For unto us a child is born
\par   Today our salvation has come.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Jesus the only true saviour
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   for all the people of the world
\par   and all who would believe in him
\par   would greatly benefit from him.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   He is the only son of God
\par       He came from heaven to the earth
\par       to take up the nature of man
\par      He was born of  the flesh and blood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  We no longer fear sin nor death
\par      since God Himself is now with us
\par      we laugh at satan and his crew
\par      with Jesus here, we shiver not
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Jesus has become our brother
\par      God has made us all His children
\par      What a generous gesture of love?
\par \pard       Let us then worship Him always.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

